"每次终端会话结束后，Aster 会调用本机的 %@ CLI，把该会话的命令、退出码与输出摘录整理成摘要交给它提炼。这些内容会离开本机，按该 Agent 自己的隐私策略处理。\n\n不发送：prompt 正文、工具参数全文、环境变量、被排除目录与排除命令的任何内容。\n\n关闭此开关时，Aster 仍会用完全本地的规则式提炼生成 Memory。" = "After each terminal session ends, Aster calls the local %@ CLI, organizing that session's commands, exit codes, and output excerpts into a summary for it to refine. This content leaves your machine and is handled per that agent's own privacy policy.\n\nNot sent: prompt bodies, full tool argument text, environment variables, or anything from excluded directories and excluded commands.\n\nWhen this switch is off, Aster still generates Memory using fully local rule-based refinement.";
